<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy up to 7,000/T July MTBE.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy up to 7,000/T July MTBE.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has tendered to buy 3,500 to 7,000-tonnes of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) for delivery July 6-20 to Kaohsiung or Keelung, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender for the gasoline octane enhancer, closes May 28 and is valid for two days.</p>
<p>CPC's last spot tender, for June 10-24 delivery, was awarded to Italian producer Ecofuel at $267 per tonne on a cost-and-freight basis.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
